# Source distribution: the package (src/), and the texts a packager or a reader needs.
# The tests, the validation scripts and the Stata reference results stay in the repository
# (they need validation/ and the data of Hansen 1999, which are not distributed with the package).
include LICENSE NOTICE.md README.md CHANGELOG.md CITATION.cff CONTRIBUTING.md
recursive-include docs *.md
prune docs/latex
global-exclude *.py[cod] __pycache__ *.log
